  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Lonely Steel Sheet Flyer**: back after 84 archived shows (2061 days); rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n- **It's Got Old**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n- **improvised country tune**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **The Wheel**: back after 50 archived shows (532 days) [4]\n- **banter & Jet tease**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Presumptuous**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n- **Most of What I Like (inc. Praise You )**: back after 50 archived shows (532 days); rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2023-06-04.ShureMV88** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 119 min [1]\n- **kglw2023-06-04**: source not stated; 16 songs; 118 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [2]. Said about its sound: Fans bumping the mic rail create slight audible noise in certain sections [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Listener called this performance the best version of the song they have ever witnessed [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2023-06-04.ShureMV88**: taped by Funk It Blog; transferred by Funk It Blog; source: Shure MV88 > iPhone 7 > Motiv Audio App > WAV [1]. Also: Recorded by Funk It Blog from row K, with final tracks patched from Mr. Mountjoy [1]\n- **kglw2023-06-04**: taped by Chris Cage; transferred by Chris Cage; source: schoeps ccm41v>audioroot>sd744 [2]. Also: A Home Team Dirty South recording using Schoeps mics, transferred via Audacity and CD Wave [2]",
